{
	"info": {
		"name": "KMS Module - Agrofusion Audit",
		"description": "Colección de endpoints para el módulo KMS (Key Management Service)\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANTE: Antes de usar esta colección, debes:\n1. Obtener un token JWT desde el módulo de autenticación (auth)\n2. Configurar la variable 'access_token' en esta colección con tu token\n3. El token debe tener el formato: Bearer <token>\n\nPara obtener el token, usa el endpoint de login del módulo auth.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"exec": [
					"// Validar que access_token esté configurado",
					"const accessToken = pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token');",
					"if (!accessToken || accessToken === '') {",
					"    console.warn('⚠️ ADVERTENCIA: access_token no está configurado. Configura la variable access_token con tu token JWT.');",
					"    console.warn('   Puedes obtener el token desde el endpoint de login del módulo auth.');",
					"}"
				],
				"type": "text/javascript"
			}
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Gestión de Claves",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Crear Clave Criptográfica",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Capturar key_id automáticamente de la respuesta",
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (response.key_id) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('key_id', response.key_id);",
									"        console.log('✓ key_id guardado:', response.key_id);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"project_id\": \"{{project_id}}\",\n  \"key_alias\": \"test-key-2025\",\n  \"algorithm\": \"RSA-2048\",\n  \"key_purpose\": \"signing\",\n  \"valid_to\": \"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys"]
						},
						"description": "Crea una nueva clave criptográfica para un proyecto. El key_id se guarda automáticamente."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Obtener Clave por ID",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/{{key_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "{{key_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene información pública de una clave criptográfica"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Listar Claves de Proyecto",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys?project_id={{project_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "project_id",
									"value": "{{project_id}}"
								},
								{
									"key": "status_filter",
									"value": "",
									"disabled": true
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Lista todas las claves de un proyecto"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Obtener Claves Activas",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/project/{{project_id}}/active",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "project", "{{project_id}}", "active"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "key_purpose",
									"value": "",
									"disabled": true
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene todas las claves activas y válidas de un proyecto"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. Rotar Clave",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Validar que key_id exista",
									"const keyId = pm.collectionVariables.get('key_id');",
									"if (!keyId || keyId === '') {",
									"    throw new Error('ERROR: Primero debes crear una clave. Ejecuta \"1. Crear Clave Criptográfica\" primero.');",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"rotation_reason\": \"scheduled\",\n  \"grace_period_days\": 30\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/{{key_id}}/rotate",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "{{key_id}}", "rotate"]
						},
						"description": "Rota una clave criptográfica generando una nueva.\n\nNOTA: El key_id viene de la URL (variable {{key_id}}), NO se envía en el body.\n\nOpciones para rotation_reason:\n- scheduled: Rotación programada\n- compromised: Clave comprometida\n- manual: Rotación manual\n- policy: Por política de seguridad"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "6. Historial de Rotaciones",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/keys/{{key_id}}/rotations",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "keys", "{{key_id}}", "rotations"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene el historial de rotaciones de una clave"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Endpoints para gestión de claves criptográficas"
		},
		{
			"name": "Firmas Digitales",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Crear Firma Digital",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Validar que key_id exista",
									"const keyId = pm.collectionVariables.get('key_id');",
									"if (!keyId || keyId === '') {",
									"    throw new Error('ERROR: Primero debes crear una clave. Ejecuta \"1. Crear Clave Criptográfica\" primero.');",
									"}",
									"",
									"// Calcular hash del documento automáticamente",
									"const document = pm.collectionVariables.get('document_content') || 'Documento de prueba';",
									"const hash = CryptoJS.SHA256(document).toString();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('document_hash', hash);",
									"console.log('✓ Hash calculado:', hash);",
									"console.log('✓ Usando key_id:', keyId);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Capturar signature_id y digital_signature automáticamente",
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (response.signature_id) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('signature_id', response.signature_id);",
									"        console.log('✓ signature_id guardado:', response.signature_id);",
									"    }",
									"    if (response.digital_signature) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('digital_signature', response.digital_signature);",
									"        console.log('✓ digital_signature guardado');",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"document_hash\": \"{{document_hash}}\",\n  \"key_id\": \"{{key_id}}\",\n  \"hash_algorithm\": \"SHA-256\",\n  \"signature_format\": \"PKCS7\",\n  \"include_timestamp\": true,\n  \"document_type\": \"test_document\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures"]
						},
						"description": "Firma digitalmente un documento usando una clave del KMS. El hash se calcula automáticamente."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Validar Firma Digital",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"document_hash\": \"{{document_hash}}\",\n  \"digital_signature\": \"{{digital_signature}}\",\n  \"signature_id\": \"{{signature_id}}\",\n  \"hash_algorithm\": \"SHA-256\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/verify",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "verify"]
						},
						"description": "Valida una firma digital verificando su integridad criptográfica"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Obtener Firma por ID",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/{{signature_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "{{signature_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene información detallada de una firma digital"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Listar Firmas de Proyecto",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures?project_id={{project_id}}&limit=10&offset=0",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "project_id",
									"value": "{{project_id}}"
								},
								{
									"key": "limit",
									"value": "10"
								},
								{
									"key": "offset",
									"value": "0"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Lista las firmas digitales de un proyecto con paginación"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. Obtener Firmas de Documento",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/signatures/document/{{document_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "signatures", "document", "{{document_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene todas las firmas asociadas a un documento específico"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Endpoints para firma y validación de documentos"
		},
		{
			"name": "Certificados",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Registrar Certificado X.509",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"key_id\": \"{{key_id}}\",\n  \"certificate_pem\": \"-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\\n...\\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----\",\n  \"serial_number\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"subject\": \"CN=Test Certificate\",\n  \"issuer\": \"CN=Test CA\",\n  \"valid_from\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"valid_to\": \"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/certificates",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "certificates"]
						},
						"description": "Registra un certificado X.509 asociado a una clave del KMS"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Obtener Certificado de Clave",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/certificates/key/{{key_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "certificates", "key", "{{key_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene el certificado más reciente asociado a una clave"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Endpoints para gestión de certificados X.509"
		},
		{
			"name": "Root CA (RF-INT-11)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Inicializar Root CA",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Capturar ca_id automáticamente de la respuesta",
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (response.ca_id) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('ca_id', response.ca_id);",
									"        console.log('✓ ca_id guardado:', response.ca_id);",
									"        console.log('✓ subject:', response.subject);",
									"        console.log('✓ serial_number:', response.serial_number);",
									"        console.log('✓ fingerprint:', response.fingerprint);",
									"    }",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 409) {",
									"    console.warn('⚠️  Ya existe una Root CA activa. Consulta GET /kms/ca-root para ver la existente.');",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"algorithm\": \"RSA-2048\",\n  \"subject\": \"CN=AgroFusion Root CA,O=AgroFusion,C=CO\",\n  \"validity_days\": 3650\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/ca-root",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "ca-root"]
						},
						"description": "Inicializa la Autoridad Certificadora Raíz del sistema (RF-INT-11).\n\nSolo se puede ejecutar una vez: si ya existe una Root CA activa responde 409 CA_ROOT_ALREADY_EXISTS.\n\nOpciones válidas:\n- algorithm: RSA-2048 | RSA-4096 | ECDSA-P256 | ECDSA-P384\n- validity_days: ≥ 3650 (10 años)\n- subject: Distinguished Name de la CA\n\nSi omites cualquier campo se usan los valores configurados en .env."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Obtener Root CA activa",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/ca-root",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "ca-root"]
						},
						"description": "Devuelve los metadatos de la Root CA activa (sin clave privada). Incluye ca_id, subject, issuer, serial_number, fingerprint, certificate_pem, public_key, valid_from, valid_to y status.\n\nResponde 404 CA_ROOT_NOT_FOUND si aún no se ha inicializado."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Exportar Certificado público de la Root CA",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/kms/ca-root/certificate",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["kms", "ca-root", "certificate"]
						},
						"description": "Exporta el certificado X.509 público de la Root CA activa en formato PEM. Útil para validaciones externas de firmas emitidas por el sistema.\n\nNo requiere permisos administrativos: cualquier usuario autenticado puede consumirlo."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Endpoints de la Autoridad Certificadora Raíz interna del sistema (RF-INT-11).\n\nLa Root CA se genera automáticamente en el arranque del backend si no existe una activa (auto-seed). También puede inicializarse manualmente con POST /kms/ca-root.\n\nReglas:\n- Solo puede existir una Root CA con status = 'active'.\n- Vigencia mínima 10 años (3650 días).\n- Clave privada cifrada con AES-256-GCM + IV aleatorio por registro usando KMS_MASTER_KEY.\n- Fingerprint SHA-256 sobre el certificado en formato DER.\n- MD5 y SHA-1 prohibidos en todo el proceso."
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:9000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
